# 🔍 Parse-Local

**Local AI web scraper — like [Parse.bot](https://parse.bot) but fully private.**

Give it a URL, describe what you want, get back structured JSON.
No API keys. No cloud. No data leaves your machine.

<br>

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10+-3776AB?style=flat-square&logo=python&logoColor=white)
![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-009688?style=flat-square&logo=fastapi&logoColor=white)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-22c55e?style=flat-square)
![Model](https://img.shields.io/badge/LLM-Mistral_Nemo_12B-ff6b35?style=flat-square)

<br>

---

<br>

## ⚡ Quick Start

> [!NOTE]
> First run will download the model (~7 GB). Subsequent starts are instant.

**Linux & macOS**

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/parse-local.git
cd parse-local
chmod +x setup.sh && ./setup.sh
source .venv/bin/activate && python -m app.main
```

**Windows**

```bat
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/parse-local.git
cd parse-local
setup.bat
.venv\Scripts\activate && python -m app.main
```

**Docker**

```bash
docker-compose up --build
```

Then open **[http://localhost:8000](http://localhost:8000)**

<br>

---

<br>

## 📋 Requirements

| | Minimum | Recommended |
|---|---|---|
| **Python** | 3.10+ | 3.11+ |
| **RAM** | 8 GB | 16 GB+ |
| **Disk** | 8 GB free | SSD |
| **GPU** | — | NVIDIA 8GB+ VRAM |

<br>

---

<br>

## 🔌 API

**Scrape a live URL**

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/scrape/url \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com",
    "prompt": "Extract the top 10 story titles and scores"
  }'
```

**Parse raw HTML**

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/scrape/html \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "html": "<div>...</div>",
    "prompt": "Extract all product names and prices"
  }'
```

**Response**

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { "..." },
  "elapsed_seconds": 14.2
}
```

<br>

