<br>

## ⚙️ Configuration

Create a `.env` file in the project root and override any defaults:

```bash
N_GPU_LAYERS=-1     # -1 = all layers on GPU, 0 = CPU only
N_CTX=8192          # context window — increase for longer pages
TEMPERATURE=0.1     # lower = more consistent output
PORT=8000           # server port
```

<br>

---

<br>

## 🖥️ GPU Acceleration

> [!TIP]
> GPU is optional but makes extraction 5–10x faster.

**NVIDIA (CUDA)**

```bash
pip uninstall llama-cpp-python -y
CMAKE_ARGS="-DGGML_CUDA=on" pip install llama-cpp-python --no-cache-dir
```

**Apple Silicon (Metal)**

```bash
pip uninstall llama-cpp-python -y
CMAKE_ARGS="-DGGML_METAL=on" pip install llama-cpp-python --no-cache-dir
```

Then set `N_GPU_LAYERS=-1` in your `.env` file.

<br>

