<br>

## 🔧 Troubleshooting

<details>
<summary><b>Model download failed</b></summary>

Download `Mistral-Nemo-Instruct-2407-Q4_K_M.gguf` manually from
[bartowski/Mistral-Nemo-Instruct-2407-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/bartowski/Mistral-Nemo-Instruct-2407-GGUF)
and place it in the `models/` directory.

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>llama-cpp-python install failed</b></summary>

Make sure build tools are installed first:

```bash
# Linux
sudo apt-get install build-essential cmake -y

# macOS
xcode-select --install
```

On Windows, install [Visual Studio Build Tools](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/visual-cpp-build-tools/)
with the **C++ build tools** workload selected, then rerun `setup.bat`.

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>Out of memory</b></summary>

Set `N_CTX=4096` or `N_GPU_LAYERS=0` in your `.env` file.

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>Port already in use</b></summary>

```bash
PORT=8080 python -m app.main
```

</details>

